    "energy_units": "Fixed quadratic hidden-state energy in model coordinates; not an independently measured physical energy.",
    "hypothesis": "With all coupling amplitudes at the lower bound, the finite fitted transient force w0 = g*z0 can require large hidden states. Train momentum fitting eliminates an unconstrained event-specific w0, while inference must recover z0 from 100 ms of observations. Low history residual together with very large saved hidden-state energy and poor train/val forecasts is consistent with this compatibility problem. The observations do not establish a unique causal mechanism; model/excitation mismatch can also contribute.",
    "next_investigation_boundary": "Any follow-up must be separately registered and use train/val to investigate reachable initial states, the nuisance-state scale and the post-origin force model. These test results cannot tune that investigation's model or thresholds."
  },
  "findings_zh": [
    "合成数据的四项记忆核恢复门槛通过；真实 TASK3 的完整预测结果失败。两类证据分别成立，合成恢复成功不能推出真实数据预测有效。",
    "四个真实候选方案均在第 17 次更新后因 nuisance momentum block 秩不足停止，未收敛。全部选择第 0 次更新，其完整 val 归一化 MSE 为 43.56676772369589；后续第 10、17 次更新的完整 val 指标均无效。",
    "B 选择 neither，与 A 的冻结检查点和保存结果相同；两份结果不构成独立验证。",
    "每个模型均完成 train 346、val 107、test 76 个来源限定事件。test 的 67 个八秒目标及 9 个失稳样本实际可用时段均通过数值资格检查，预测数值失败为零。",
    "当前模型在各 split 的 1、2、5、8 秒事件平均和 pooled 归一化 RMSE 均高于保存的 R20/R21 结果。数值资格通过说明这一差距不能归因于本次已检查的积分步长失效。",
    "test 稳定性为 TP/TN/FP/FN=9/0/48/0，19 例未决，57/76 例可判定；完整准确率为 null，可判定准确率为 9/57，稳定误报率为 48/48。",
    "保留默认基线。此次记录用于报告完整失败结果，不支持参数恢复、稳定性认证或模型推广结论。"
  ],
